# Reordering the Today view, quitting and reopening keeps the order, and so does another program editing an unrelated line.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-1})
END
keys gt G <A-k> <A-k>
see ▌ - Pay rent  Home
restart
see 󰖙 Today
keys gg
see ▌ - Pay rent  Home
outside <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-1})
	- Fix the shelf
END
status Reloaded
keys j x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today}) @done({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
Home:
	- Pay rent @due({today-1})
	- Fix the shelf
END
